{"t":"Primal Set","s":"primal-set-81f95","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/NoAmulet_cb0c43.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>The <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Primal Set</strong> consists of some the best equipment in the game and have a minimum level requirement of 400. The Set consists of 3 pieces of equipment for each vocation, but only for slots for which there are no <a href=\"#/wiki/Soul%20Set\">Soul Set</a> items.\n</p><p>All vocations have a ring which can be charged with <a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Token\">Silver Tokens</a>. The charged rings offer more benefits and last for 3 hours, but the rings still have attributes even when discharged.\n</p><p>Since the items have different names, they can also be split into one set per vocation:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a>: <a href=\"#/wiki/Spiritthorn%20Set\">Spiritthorn Set</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a>: <a href=\"#/wiki/Alicorn%20Set\">Alicorn Set</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a>: <a href=\"#/wiki/Arcanomancer%20Set\">Arcanomancer Set</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druids</a>: <a href=\"#/wiki/Arboreal%20Set\">Arboreal Set</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Monk\">Monks</a>: <a href=\"#/wiki/Ethereal%20Set\">Ethereal Set</a></li></ul>\n<p>The items can be obtained as a one-time reward of the <a href=\"#/quest/primal-ordeal-quest\">Primal Ordeal Quest</a> as well as from its boss and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Plunder%20Patriarch\">Plunder Patriarch</a> through the Hazard system.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Knight_Set\">Knight Set</span></h2>\n<div class=\"equips_set_basic\">\n<div style=\"left:1px;top:19px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NoAmulet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NoAmulet_cb0c43.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></div>\n<div style=\"left:1px;top:55px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"